sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Tester as QA / Test Runner
    participant Spec as UI Spec File
    participant Fixture as Custom Fixture
    participant Workflow as Login / Business Workflow
    participant PO as Page Object
    participant Browser as Browser Utilities / Page
    participant UI as Unsplash Web UI
    participant Assert as Playwright Assertions

    Tester->>Spec: Run UI test
    Spec->>Fixture: Request injected objects
    Fixture-->>Spec: Provide pages and workflows
    Spec->>Workflow: Execute reusable business flow
    Workflow->>PO: Call page-level actions
    PO->>Browser: Perform wrapped browser interactions
    Browser->>UI: Navigate, click, fill, wait
    UI-->>Browser: Render state and responses
    Browser-->>PO: Return visible state or text
    PO-->>Spec: Return result data
    Spec->>Assert: Validate expected behavior
    Assert-->>Tester: Pass / fail result
